PROMPT.md
prompt.md

# --- published artifacts, re-included above ---------------------------------
# results/ is regenerated output, but the figures the README embeds and the metrics JSON that
# every number in RESULTS.md is derived from have to be in the repo, or the README shows broken
# images on GitHub and no reader can check a single figure against its source data.
# Kept as the single copy rather than duplicated into docs/, so a regenerated figure shows up as a
# diff instead of silently disagreeing with a stale published one.
!results/*.png
!results/*.gif
!results/*.json
# ...except this one: 17 MB of queue-depth samples from an unpaced throughput run, cited by no table.
results/phase2_fasttier_unpaced.json
# Scratch/diagnostic runs that no document references.
results/_*.json
results/diag_*.json
results/ci_smoke.json
